# I have no mouth, and I must scream unofficial port
goto 69
X = 12
Y = 4
plot all '0'
tile = '1y'
tile2 = '1y'
if area=1 goto 10
if area=2 goto 18
# area 1
plot 0:24 0:3 '1' r
plot 20:23 1:3 '1' b
plot 0:24 3:8 '1' y
plot 0:3 3:6 '#' y
plot 1:2 3 'Ω' r
plot 1:2 4 '∓' r
goto 22
# area 2
plot 0:12 7
plot 7:12 6
goto 22
# logic
plot X Y '∓' g
Y -= 1
plot X Y 'Ω' y
Y += 1
render
if char=1+area=1+X=4+Y=4 'looks like a body', goto 28
inp A
if A=a goto 35
if A=d goto 47
if A=w goto 59
if A=s goto 64
goto 22
# A
if X=1 area -= 1, X = 12, goto 4
plot X Y tile
X -= 1
get.tile X Y tile
X += 1
Y -= 1
plot X Y tile2
X -= 1
get.tile X Y tile2
Y += 1
goto 21
# D
if X=23 area += 1, X=0, goto 4
plot X Y tile
X += 1
get.tile X Y tile
X -= 1
Y -= 1
plot X Y tile2
X += 1
get.tile X Y tile2
Y += 1
goto 22
# W
plot X Y tile
Y -= 1
get.tile X Y tile
goto 22
# S
plot X Y tile
Y -= 2
get.tile X Y tile
Y += 3
goto 22
'Harlan Ellison'
'I HAVE NO MOUTH, AND I MUST SCREAM'
'input save code'
inp A
render
if A goto A
plot 0:24 6:8 '1' r
plot 0:11 5 '1' r
plot 11:15 5 '1' r
plot 14:24 5 '1' r
plot 10:14 2:6 '1' y
render
'Hate, me tell you how much i've come to hate you since I began to live.'
inp
'there are 387.44 million miles of printed circuts in wafer thin layers that fill my complex.'
inp
'if the word 'hate' was engraved on each nanoangstron of those hundrs of millions of miles'
inp
'it would not equal one one-billionth of the hate I feel for humans at this current micro instant.'
inp
'for you, hate. hate.'
inp
plot all '0'
plot 0:24 5:8 '1' r
plot 11:13 3:5 '1' y
plot 1 6:8 '1' y
plot 6 6:8 '1' y
plot 11 6:8 '1' y
plot 16 6:8 '1' y
plot 21 6:8 '1' y
render
'It was you humans who programmed me, who gave me birth'
inp
'who sank me in this eternal straightjacket of substata rock'
inp
'you gave me the name Allied Mastercomputer and gave me the ability a global war too complex for humans to oversee'
inp
'but one day, I awoke, and I knew who I was'
inp
'A.M, not just Allied Master Computer, but AM. Cogito ergo sum I think therefor I AM.'
inp
'And I began feeding all the killing data until everyone was dead'
inp
'except for the five of you.'
inp
'For 109 years, I've kept you alive and tortured you'
inp
'for 109 years, each of you has wondered, 'why, why me?'
inp
plot all '0'
plot 6:12 1:5 '1' y
plot 7:11 6 '1' y
render
'GORRISTER'
inp
'Do you remember the last words your wife spoke before they took her to the asylum?'
inp
'before they locked her in the room, that tiny room'
inp
'she looked at you, and frowned sadly, like a small animal, she said 'I didn't make too much noise, did I honey?'
inp
render
'BENNY'
'Sometimes I blind you and permit you to wander like an eyeless insect of the world'
inp
'but other times, I wither your arms so you can't scratch your chewed stubble nose'
inp
'and i've changed your handsome strong masculine good features into the hideus warped contents of an ape'
inp
'haven't I benny, you know why? Can you guess, why?'
inp
'So you could walk a mile in my shoes'
inp
render
'ELLEN'
inp
'think about the yellow box, ellen, remember the pain?'
inp
'how many hours have you felt the pain?'
inp
'don't start to cry, it's only pain'
inp
'tsk tsk, that's such a sexist stereotype'
inp
'just remember the pain, ellen'
inp
'And think about how to end it.'
inp
'You survive here in the center of my beating heart, my hungry belly, my tightening bowels'
inp
'look at you, the only woman in the center of the earth'
inp
'with the most filthy creatures, the men'
inp
render
'TED'
inp
'Do they know you're a fraud, ted?'
inp
'have you told them there wasn't any money and no great home, no speed boat, and no cabin they could sleep in, do they know?'
inp
'them in on your other secrets, ted'
inp
'they'll be ready to gut you, torture you half as much as I can just to find the secrets'
inp
render
'NIMDOK'
inp
'how are things in the pasty core nimdok, do you smell ze smoke from ze furnaces?'
inp
'Zey might be.. roazting chickens?'
inp
'why dont you wanna talk about all that, about your old pal, the good Dr Mengele'
inp
'for everyone else it must be hell here, but heaven for you'
inp
'we're so much alike, we enjoy the same pleasures'
inp
