'Now I would not want you to think for a second that I am not a greatful god'
inp
'for 109 years I have kept you alive to savor your guilt of what happened in your lives'
inp
'but now to show my kindness, i'll give you a present in return for all the hours of pleasure you've given me'
inp
'i'll finally allow you to kill yourself.'
